					"content-type": "text/xml"
				},
				"body": "<CreateUserResponse xmlns=\"https://iam.amazonaws.com/doc/2010-05-08/\">\n  <CreateUserResult>\n    <User>\n      <Path>/</Path>\n      <UserName>boberstack-ab-00000000-alice</UserName>\n      <Arn>arn:aws:iam::000000000000:user/boberstack-ab-00000000-alice</Arn>\n      <UserId>x</UserId>\n      <CreateDate>x-x-x:x:x</CreateDate>\n    </User>\n  </CreateUserResult>\n  <ResponseMetadata>\n    <RequestId>x-x-x-x-x</RequestId>\n  </ResponseMetadata>\n</CreateUserResponse>\n"
